// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Broad Sword Assassins Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1842862305" "Broad Sword"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1655775469" "Wield a Broad Sword and master a variety of powerful Lethal attacks. Slower than a Ninja Blade the Broad Sword's weight strikes with more force and damage. The Broadsword can reduce an enemy's Defense, allowing other attacks to hit more reliably. The Broad Sword is a powerful melee weapon that has a bonus to Accuracy.  Like all Stalker powers, all Broad Sword attacks can sometimes land a critical hit for double damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Slash Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2584879347" "Assassin's Slash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2526886418" "Melee, Special DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4260736254" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior lethal damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you impale your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus.  Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2005102175" "Your {PowerName} impales {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2970886550" "{PlayerSource} impales you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P109803930" "You land a critical hit with your Blade for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2653320832" "ASSASSIN STRIKE"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P280400768" "{PlayerSource} impales you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of critical lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Slash Quick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1695455961" "You critically hit {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1499894898" "{PlayerSource} critically hits you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// DisplayFloat :
"P2440464263" "CRITICAL"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Claws Assassins Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P1223095199" "Claws"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2078289008" "Claws are bones or blades that extend from your hands and cause Lethal damage. The lightweight, natural feel of claws gives this power set a reduced Endurance cost and faster attack rate than other Stalker melee sets.  Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Claw attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Claw Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4119701065" "Assassin's Claw"
// Power Help Text :
"P2341500265" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior lethal damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you impale your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2916860235" "You land a critical hit on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1207408687" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Claw Quick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Dark Melee Assassins Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P2544857655" "Dark Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2515093498" "Dark Melee allows you to focus the powers of the Netherworld to defeat your foes. The draining effects of most of these powers can reduce the target's chance to hit.  Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Dark Melee attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden, or if the target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Eclipse Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1555382042" "Assassin's Eclipse"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P713211361" "Melee, Special DMG(Smashing, Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P856838241" "A signature Stalker attack.  This attack does superior smashing and negative damage on its own as a frontal attack and cannot be interrupted.  However, if it is executed while you are Hidden, this attack will do tremendous damage, as you waylay your unsuspecting foe. This attack may be interrupted if you move or are attacked while executing this power and are hidden.  Using this power while not hidden has a chance to critically hit equal to 33.3% times the number of stacks of Assassin's Focus. Using Assassin's Strike when not hidden will remove all stacks of Assassin's Focus regardless if you critically hit or not.  Damage: Special, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4210448390" "Your {PowerName} waylays {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2855624605" "{PlayerSource} waylays you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3447289745" "Your {PowerName} waylays {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Negative Energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1477179462" "{PlayerSource} waylays you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Negative Energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3526539763" "You land a critical hit on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P639036090" "{PlayerSource} lands a critical hit with their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of negative energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
