"P3267007910" "Kinetic Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1451500042" "Kinetic Melee features a mix of fast light attacks and slow heavy attacks, including some with range.  All attacks in this set except Assassin's Strike reduce the damage strength of enemies who are hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Strike Stealth 
