// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ninja Blade Assassins Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P456380780" "Ninja Blade"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2946740511" "Wield a Ninja Blade and master a variety of powerful Lethal attacks. A quick and elegant weapon, the Ninja Blade can reduce an enemy's Defense. The Ninja Blade is a fine blade that always has a bonus to Accuracy. Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Ninja Blade attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Blade Stealth 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1094205891" "Assassins Blade Stealth"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3728178801" "You land a critical hit with your {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of lethal damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassins Blade Quick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P982534783" "Assassins Blade Quick"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Spines Assassins Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P401332978" "Spines"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1457756702" "Spines protrude from your body and can deal damage in melee or at very short ranges. Spines are hollow and hold a neural toxin that deals additional Toxic damage and can Slow or Immobilize your enemies. The toxin is cumulative, and multiple hits will affect a target more strongly.  Very few foes have resistance to Spine poison. Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Spine attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

