// DisplayName :
"P299072224" "Corruptor_BeamRifle_Snipe"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P579523066" "Beam Rifle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Penetrating Ray Quick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1466089441" "Penetrating Ray"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P200988667" "Sniper, Extreme Dmg(Energy), Foe Knockdown, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P900340505" "You take careful aim at your target and deliver a punishing supercharged shot from your Beam Rifle. This causes Extreme Energy damage and may knock the target off their feet. If the target is also suffering from the Disintegrating effect it will also suffer additional damage over time. This is a sniper attack, but due to your high chance to hit, it is not interruptible. In addition, targets already affected by the Disintegrating effect will cause this effect to spread to 3 nearby targets. This Disintegrate Spread effect can only hit targets that aren't already affected by the Disintegrating effect. Disintegrate Spread causes Minor Energy damage over time. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4267120592" "You obliterate {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3992926182" "{PlayerSource} snipes you for {Damage} points of energy damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P935782005" "Your Disintegrate effect causes {PowerName} to deal {Damage} points of additional energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2071389446" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of additional energy damage due to your Disintegrating effect."
// DisplayFloat :
"P3729946649" "Disintegrate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1746676435" "Your {PowerName} blasts {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of energy damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Penetrating Ray Normal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P794263569" "You take careful aim at your target and deliver a punishing supercharged shot from your Beam Rifle. This causes Extreme Energy damage and may knock the target off their feet. If the target is also suffering from the Disintegrating effect it will also suffer additional damage over time. Like all Sniper attacks it will be interrupted if you're attacked. In addition, targets already affected by the Disintegrating effect will cause this effect to spread to 3 nearby targets. This Disintegrate Spread effect can only hit targets that aren't already affected by the Disintegrating effect. Disintegrate Spread causes Minor Energy damage over time. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Slow"

